      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.callout-note collapse=\"true\"}\n",
        "## `cross_val_score`\n",
        "`cross_val_score()` is a shorter way to obtain `cv_result[\"test_score\"]` from the `cross_validate()` section. The arguments `cv` and `scoring` work in the same way."
      ],
      "id": "52e52f99"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
